window.products.push({"id":943049,"name":"Inofia Mattress Topper, 3-Inch Gel-Infused King Memory Foam Mattress Pad, Ventilated 2-Layer Design with Removable Cover, CertiPUR-US Foam (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qan1c75wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Upgrade Your Sleep】Inofia mattress topper is designed with all foam system to respond to your body’s weight and shape for precise, personalized comfort and support while you sleep. Gel infused beads help keep you sleep at an optimal temperature. The topper enhances comfort and support to your old mattress, guest beds, bedroom or sofa without breaking the bank. 【Two Comfort Choices】This mattress combines 2 layers of different foam types to create a brilliantly balanced, supportive and ventilated sleep experience. The mattress is soft on one side and firm on the other. No matter which side you prefer, our proprietary foam blend will provide contoured support, relieve painful pressure point fatigue, and keep you cool and comfortable all night long. 【Total Pressure Relief】The memory foam is infused with cool gel beads to give you extra comfort and support as your back shifts throughout the night. The high-density support foam with proper firmness to keep your spine aligned while eliminating pressure points. The two-layer work together to minimize strain from your body’s pressure points. 【Breathable & Ventilated】The cover of Inofia mattress topper is made of breathable kitted fabric that wicks heat and moisture away, helping you stay cool throughout the night. The cover is Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certificated which has no safety and environmental concerns. Fully removable and machine washable for easy cleaning care. 【Smartly Shipped & No risk】Our mattress toppers are efficiently compressed, rolled and shipped in a box. Inofia isn't just comfortable, pressure-relieving and supportive, it's also extremely durable. We offer a 100-night worry-free trial to every customer. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qan1c75wL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inofia","source_asin":"B088JVTW29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088JVTW29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088JVTW29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
