window.products.push({"id":943125,"name":"Audrey Hepburn Decorative Quote Books, Set of 4 Books, Decor for Coffee Table and Bookshelf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DZisMgVvL.jpg","description":"Audrey Hepburn said it best, \"Happy girls are the prettiest girls\". Four new hardcover blank books/journals are turned into art with the application of custom covers/dust jackets. These books are sure to be the perfect accent piece for your bookshelf or coffee table. - NUMBER OF BOOKS: 4 - SIZE: Each blank book is approx. 9.25” wide x 7\" deep x 1.3-1.5\" spine - COLOR: White covers with black text The covers are made of a heavy satin paper with a matte laminate finish for beauty and long-term durability. The cover flaps are attached securely to the books. Please note: These are decorative books only. The books used for this set are blank books (unlined pages) and do not relate to fashion, designers, or the theme. When attired in their new clothes, the books become beautiful bookshelf art. Please double-check the accuracy of your order. Because these items are handmade at time of order, I cannot accept returns for errors made in color selection. All returns are subject to a 20% restocking fee. Thank you! Thanks for looking and allowing me to combine two of my interests – a love of reading and an appreciation for beautiful design!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DZisMgVvL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artful Library","source_asin":"B07VJ1CLFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VJ1CLFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VJ1CLFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943126,"name":"Mikasa Platinum Crown Creamer, 6-Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311XD3ZAJGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Tasteful Platinum Crown collection will bring sophistication and class to your dining room table. This elegant white dinnerware pattern is trimmed with embossed platinum bands, perfect for formal occasions. Crafted of porcelain. Dishwasher safe but not microwave safe. When washing gold or platinum banded dinnerware in the dishwasher, use a gentle cycle and turn off the dishwasher before the drying cycle, or allow the dinnerware to cool before handling it. The high temperature of the heated drying cycle can cause the precious metal bands to soften. The creamer holds 6 ounces. Amazon.com The Platinum Crown fine china collection from Mikasa is a regal pattern, better suited to the formal dining table than to the breakfast nook. The crisp white surfaces and gleaming platinum bring a richness to the table for special occasions. Platinum Crown is one of Mikasa's Fine China patterns, made from chip-resistant high-fired china with a lustrous glaze. The Platinum Crown creamer is short and round, with a small pedestal foot and a smartly curled handle. The platinum trim runs around the base, rim, and handle, as well as a thin band at its widest circumference. A stylized, silver-toned border crowns the creamer at the rim, interrupted only by the generous pour spout. Mikasa's Platinum Crown collection offers a matching covered sugar bowl and coffee pitcher, as well as full 5-piece place settings and a wide range of serving pieces. Mikasa fine china pieces with metallic ornamentation--such as Platinum Crown--are not for use in the microwave or freezer. They are, however, dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Use the gentle cycle and turn off the dishwasher before the drying cycle; heated drying cycles can be hot enough to soften the metal trim. When hand washing, avoid abrasive cleansers or scrubbers to help protect the metal trim. The 8-ounce creamer stands 3 inches tall and has a 4-inch diameter (5-3/4 inches across including handle and spout). --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311XD3ZAJGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mikasa","source_asin":"B0000C1MRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C1MRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C1MRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943127,"name":"Mason Cash Innovative Kitchen Stoneware Spoon and Utensil Rest with Conversion Chart, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xifpR8WyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Innovative Kitchen range from Mason Cash - Cooking and Baking Done Smartly! New for 2018, the Innovative Kitchen collection from Mason Cash takes inspiration from the professional baker to deliver smart solutions for day-to-day kitchen tasks. Each item within the range boasts a modern twist on a traditional function that brings-about increased efficiency and improved performance.  Whether it’s a tilting mixing bowl that aids stirring and whisking, a pudding basin with a removable airtight lid, a rolling pin that also dispenses flour or an egg store with a raised central hub that prevents the need to crack them on your much-loved pans, the Innovative Kitchen collection has been thoughtfully designed and executed so that cooking and baking is both easier and more enjoyable.  The range is also complemented by an ingenious assortment of beech wood utensils that enable multiple tasks to be performed with a single hand and tool. For example, the ever-valuable slotted turner features a rack grabber within the handle so that hot oven shelves can be pulled and pushed without the need for oven gloves. The essential balloon whisk doubles-up as a reamer for extracting flavoursome juice from lemons, limes and more. The multi-function spatula contains a shaped silicone rear that is perfect for scraping awkward-to-reach jam from glass jars.  Cooking and baking done smartly - courtesy of Mason Cash. About Mason Cash - History in the Baking Since 1800 Mason Cash originated in a pottery that operated from Church Gresley, Derbyshire - the heart of the English ceramic industry - in 1800. Church Gresley was situated near to all of the raw materials and fuel sources required to manufacture ceramics. It also had the transport links that enabled the finished goods to be taken all over the UK and beyond in order to be sold.  Run by a series of ‘Master Potters’, the company became renowned worldwide for producing kitchen items that were crafted from premium-quality glazed earthenware. Although inextricably associated with their iconic range of mixing bowls, Mason Cash has worked tirelessly to develop a comprehensive understanding of the ever-evolving requirements of the modern-day cook. This has allowed the company to continue to produce innovative, functional and effective kitchenware that stands the test of time. Set Contains: 1 x Mason Cash Innovative Kitchen Stoneware Spoon and Utensil Rest with Conversion Chart, White","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xifpR8WyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mason Cash","source_asin":"B076F9C3PV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076F9C3PV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076F9C3PV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
