window.products.push({"id":943359,"name":"Petiture Coffee Table Lift Top Wood Home Living Room Modern Lift Top Storage Coffee Table w/Hidden Compartment & 2 Drawers Shelves Lift Up Coffee Dini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715pE+gxZmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Contemporary Appearance】Lift Top Coffee Table with a total size of 45.3\"L x 19.7\" W x 21\"H, the coffee table dresses a complete of high-quality wooden. It features rectangular outlook with Hidden Storage Compartment and 2 Drawers. which perfectly meet your demand of durability. 【Adjustable Height】Coffee table's innovative design with hidden compartment and lift tabletop can be adjusted vertically from 16\" to 21\" to meet your different demands of desired height. Just lifting it effortlessly, there is extra storage room provided. And the stability will also be guaranteed while adjusting. 【Lift up Coffee Table with Hidden Storage & Drawers】Made of chipboard, solid wood and metal piece, petiture table features large storage rooms with 2 drawers storage design, which can well accommodate your various kinds of accessories or stuffs, such as your notebooks, glasses or other things. 【Multi-functional Coffee Table】Our coffee table is widely applied in office or home as a perfect coffee table or living room furniture for its spacious work area. Its compact structure and beautiful texture can surprisingly highlight your office or home deco, perfect for your office, living room, or study room. 【Balance Fun and Versatility】With its clean lines and contemporary flair, it will bring long-lasting character and charm to your living space through its timeless appearance. Note: Please contact us if there is any product issue, we can send free replacement part to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715pE+gxZmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Petiture","source_asin":"B08TLHGK86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TLHGK86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TLHGK86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943360,"name":"The Diet Plate Female Version, for Portion Control Made Easy Made from Fine English Earthenware, Microwave and Dishwasher Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xjjk8GgoL._AC_.jpg","description":"Lose weight wth style. First time back in the States since 2002 when you might have seen it on CNN headline News a segment which was broadcast right in the middle of the Super Bowl! The Diet Plate is quintessentially English, hand painted fine earthenware, not a decal finish but a smooth under glazing appearance, which is microwave and dishwasheot r friendly. It is made in the heart of the English potteries region and sent to you with care. Lose weight with something that graces your table, not sets you apart from the family with a clinical approach. First seen on US TV when the creator appeared on CNN Headline News in 2002, an interview which aired right in the middle of that year's Super Bowl! The Diet Plate is the ORIGINAL portion control plate to come to the market, created in 1995, launched in England in 2000, a new diet for a new millienium. The proportions on the plate follow the balance of good health, they are correct measurements of all the food group but are recipe driven, which means you can still enjoy your favorites. Diet Plate gives an amount of food which will allow you to lose weight safely, which means that your body will adjust easily to the portion sizes, making the Diet Plate plan the easiest to follow. The Diet Plate Weight Management Plan is non-dicatorial, which means that, you can eat what you love to cook, whether; western, Asian, African, English, Vegetarian or even those with food allergies can use this product to lose weight and later maintain goal weight, just because you know what foods you can eat and what suits you. It comes with a 40 page booklet, that gives full instructions on use and for those who need extra support there is free membership to the forum. The Diet Plate is not a faddy diet, but an honest and sensible eating plan for long term weight management, it is all you will ever need to help you lose weight and maintain goal weight. It is not a temporary or part time product but for long term use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xjjk8GgoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Diet Plate","source_asin":"B000H1HXZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000H1HXZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000H1HXZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943361,"name":"Christmas Snow Globes with Music, 6H Timer Lighted Snow Globes Christmas Glitter Lantern for Christmas Decorations and Gift, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71elp4MWSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅【Music Box with Light & 8 Christmas Songs】Our Christmas snow globe plays 8 Christmas songs with different Christmas themes, Jingle Bells, We Wish You A Merry Christmas, Silent Night, Deck The Halls, Joy To The World, The First Noel, Hark! The Herald Angel Sing, Oh, Christmas Tree. When you turn the button to ON1, the sequins will rotate as the lights flushing, the songs will be played in a loop, provide incredible enjoyment that you’ll never forget this Christmas. 🎅【6H ON& 18H OFF Timer Mode】Designed with the latest environmental concept, the musical snow globe has timer function. There are three ways slide switch. Switch to ON1, the light on with glitter swirling and music playing with 6h Timer. Switch to ON2, the light on (no music) with Timer for 6 hours on and 18 hours off, cycle every 24 hours. This snow globe with soft light can also be used as a night light to accompany you to sleep, and have a wonderful night. 🎅【Optional 2 Charging Ways】Comes with the USB to DC cable, just plug it in, it will keep working and without needing any batteries. Or you can use 3 AA batteries (not include), it allows you to put it wherever you want to decorate, indoors or outdoors. You can hang this solar globe lantern on the trees or window to be Christmas ornaments, or put it on the tabletop, centerpieces, nightstand, patio, porch, or the party scene. 🎅【Your Best Christmas Decorations】Celebrate this Christmas with our cute & shining snow globe lantern! There are christmas trees, santa claus, cardinal, reindeer and rabbit in the lantern, which are made of high-end resin, fine craftsmanship, exquisite and compact. When you turn on the lighting decoration, the glittering snowflakes is keeping rolling in the lantern, creates a warm and lively festive atmosphere. It is suitable for decorating your home, the garden outdoor, or the party scene. 🎅【Exquisite Gift Box Packaging】The Chirstmas snow globe with unique classical design and sweet music, it is not only a beautiful Christmas decorations for your home to add a sweetness and beauty to your holiday, but also an ideal Christmas gift for your friends, parents, kids, families. If you have any issue, please contact us via Amazon, we will do our best to give you the perfect solution and reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71elp4MWSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CaiFang","source_asin":"B08B1GJKG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B1GJKG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B1GJKG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
