window.products.push({"id":943365,"name":"Urban Legacy Reclaimed Barn Wood Shelves | Amish Handcrafted in Lancaster, PA Rustic, Floating, Industrial, Brackets [ High Weight Capacity Set of 2 (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":250.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hjnF3065L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 2 barn wood shelves, mounting hardware included - 24\" x 11\" (depth will vary slightly piece to piece) x 3\" (thickness will vary slightly ) Weight capacity is 100 Lbs. per shelf when properly installed into studs ! Raw metal brackets are hand fashioned by an Amish man in his shop (please note that raw metal exposed to excessive moisture may rust slightly over time) As these are 100% genuine reclaimed barn rafters in their natural state (no stain), you may notice minimal variations in the shade. All saw, nail and other distressed markings are naturally occurring and may vary piece to piece. Cut ends not stained. ** Shelf brackets MUST be mounted into wall studs and the studs predrilled!! 3/16\" bit recommended. *** [mounting hardware included]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hjnF3065L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Legacy","source_asin":"B07L5XRJW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5XRJW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5XRJW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943366,"name":"WHW Whole House Worlds Americana Steamer Trunks, Blanket Chests, Storage Boxes, Set of 2, Medallion and Tooled Metal Details, Hinged Top, Metal Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XK4wf7AoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COUNTRY STYLE CHARM FOR EVERYDAY LIVING bring a feeling of laid-back luxury into your spaces with Americana Trunk Set of 2. Perfect as eye-catching blanket chests, these pieces feature rustic touches like the round medallion on the top center and matching border of tooled metal work at the edges. Decorative metal accent cladding on the sides and stylish side handles add to the unique character of these trunks. MADE BY HAND Expertly crafted by our artisans of gray stained fir wood and finished to breath age, each piece in the set is made to last. Perfect for dozens of uses, use them to stow away toys, blankets, linens, laundry and much more inside each of the 2 chests. BEAUTIFULLY PROPORTIONED BY OUR DESIGNERS Well sized, these pieces measures as follows: 1- the larger: 32 L x 15 ½ W x 15 ¾ H and 2- the smaller 27 1/4 L x 11 3/4 W x 11 3/4 H inches. Each trunk has a sliding latch lock and lifting lid with an inner stay open support. VERSATILE Inspiring accent pieces with time worn appeal and a shabby chic finish, these pieces are made of lightly stained gray wood and treated to look like treasured heirlooms passed down over time. The latch on each opens to spacious storage. Designed to delight, the distressed finish on each piece imparts the look of an antique, adding to their rustic beauty. From living room to bedroom, Americana Steamer Trunks, Set of 2 are useful pieces that can help organize spaces while pulling together a room with tremendous style. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XK4wf7AoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B073HC4H4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073HC4H4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073HC4H4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
