window.products.push({"id":943441,"name":"Zeronal Tropical Banana Leaves Wall Tapestry, 59\"x79\" Palm Tree Leaf Tapestries Natural Plant Botanical Wall Hanging for Bedroom Living Room Dorm Wall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fugsc5ceL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tropical Leaves Tapestry makes you feel as if you in nature. The palm trees and banana leaves tapestry are always patterns which make you to meditate. This natural tapestry is a great decoration to cheer up your home atmosphere. It will give you a different lifestyle. Premium Material The tropical plants tapestries are made of polyester fiber, it is skin-friendly, soft and lightweight. Polyester fabric has the advantage over natural fibers, of being extremely resistant, especially to wind and water. Elegant Design We use 3D advanced digital printing technology, 3D printing is quicker than conventional manufacturing, which means we have more time to iterate the prototype, and the color is more bright and durable. Widespread Use The tropical leaves tapestry is a perfect decoration. It can be used to decorate your bedroom, living room. What's more, it can be used to be wall hangings, dorm decorations, porch hangings, table cloths, bed spreads, sofa covers, TV background, photography backdrop or any home decor. It is also a good choice for beach throws, picnic blankets or any other outdoor activities.Machine wash in cold water with gentle cycle or hand wash, please iron under low temperature, hanging to dry is OK. Size 59\"x 79\" Package Include * 1 × piece tapestry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fugsc5ceL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RosieLily","source_asin":"B07PLWGJQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PLWGJQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PLWGJQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943442,"name":"Fair Trade Uganda African Bukedo & Raffia Bowl #UR5616, 15-16\" Across","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XiDQlQWSL._AC_.jpg","description":"You will receive a basket nearly identical to this one pictured, but please keep in mind every basket is uniquely handwoven and can differ slightly. This basket is made of bukedo, the local term in Uganda for banana leaf stalks, and raffia, which comes from palm trees. Both of these materials are renewable, plentiful resources. Bukedo creates a sturdy base that dyed raffia is coiled around to make this strong basket. These baskets are traditionally used for serving food in Uganda. They look great mounted on a wall, propped on a shelf or even sitting on a table. The mission of this weaving group is to support as many other women as possible through the promotion of their handcrafts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XiDQlQWSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baskets of Africa","source_asin":"B00TYQYOQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TYQYOQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TYQYOQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
