window.products.push({"id":943713,"name":"Chinese Ceramic Art Handmade Antique ice Crack Glaze vases Big China Porcelain Flower Bottle Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nTZiWIAYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Ceramics–Vase Ceramics is a milestone in the history of mankind. It was discovered as early as a thousand years ago.It was originally a tool for putting things, and later became a work of art in the Song Dynasty (960-1279).During popular collection of ceramics, especially vases, more exquisiteness and beautiful.The traditional custom of China considers the Hua Ping or vase, which symbolizes safety or \"Ping Ping An An\" in Chinese. The vase is a kind of utensil. The vase has beautiful appearance and different shapes. Whether it is a celadon vase or a white porcelain vase or a colored porcelain vase, it is mostly used as a decorative display, and has very good collection value and ornamental value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nTZiWIAYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANLONG","source_asin":"B095H6DCXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095H6DCXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095H6DCXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943714,"name":"Phifertex Plus Mesh Replacement Cover Set for Directors Chair ROUND STICK (GREEN STRIPE)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uvYGWAhIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Breathe new life into old chairs! Our directors chair replacement covers are easy to replace and are first quality. Phifertex Plus Vinyl Mesh Fabric is a tightly woven 100% vinyl-coated woven polyester mesh. Perfect for outdoor use and 100% Made in the USA. Made from Phifertex Plus Vinyl Mesh fabric will not stretch, fade or shrink. Common round stick insert type, the most popular type made after 1980. Load tested to 400 lbs. - Rated capacity 300 lbs. Stability in all climates. Seat Back, Seat and Stiks included (replacement canvas only, no chair frame included -Includes the round 1/4\" diameter sticks Many, many different colors to choose from The measurements of this round stick replacement when laid out flat on a table are as follows (sizes may vary slightly): -Seat is 15 1/2\" Deep x 19 1/2\" wide (edge to edge) -Back is 7\" high x 21 1/2\" wide (3\" loops are flattened out, edge to edge) -Round sticks are 1/4\" in diameter (they are removeable in case you need to substitute your sticks) Please note: All monitors register color differently Chair frame is not included in this listing Phifertex Cleaning Instructions: Prepare cleaning solution using 1 tbsp. liquid dish detergent and 2 tbsp. household bleach in one gallon of water. Clean fabric with sponge or soft cloth dipped in solution. Rinse thoroughly with clear water and air dry. Avoid direct contact with oil-based products which may cause accelerated aging of fabric. If direct contact occurs, clean promptly. Regular maintenance of your Phifertex fabric will help extend the life of the fabric. Clean Phifertex 1–2 times a year when in moderate use (more frequently when used heavily).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uvYGWAhIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUSTOM","source_asin":"B00CUD6V3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CUD6V3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CUD6V3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
