window.products.push({"id":943739,"name":"Urban Green Glass Jar with Bamboo Lid, Large Glass Food Storage Jar with Airtight Lid,1 gallon, Large Size Glass Food Storage Container, Flour Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jbHwzJveL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ URBAN GREEN GLASS CONTAINER: Our redesigned airtight glass canisters are made of high quality borosilicate glass with smooth and beautifully polished Bamboo Lids are from sustainable growth bamboo groves. All of these large size glass food storage containers help to contribute to a healthier and more sustainable lifestyle as they are all plastic free, BPA free and phthalate free. The clear glass is odor and stain resistant as well. Let us make heathy products a part of your everyday life! ✅ 2021 NEW DESIGN GLASS JAR: Fresh redesigned glass jars with bamboo lids for all your needs in the kitchen, in your home office, on your bathroom vanity or around the house as accent pieces. Our products are practical, functional and stylish anywhere you display them. Our new design with a natural fiber cord on the lid is also a very thoughtful and sustainable gift item and they are heat, cold and crack resistant too. ✅ LARGE SIZE PACKS: These air-tight multi-purpose canisters are specially designed in different heights and sizes to meet all your needs. All of the glass canister sets are designed for large size food storage, the silicone ring makes the bamboo lid close tightly which ensures food or other items inside stay dry and fresh for a much longer time. They are perfect glass food containers for kitchen and pantry food organization. ✅1 GALLON EXTRA LARGE JAR: Our 1 pack Extra Large Size Glass Jar is the largest glass container, Canister Dimension is 8.25 x 6.75 inches, Volume is 1 Gallon without lid measurement. 1 extra large size wooden Scoop is included in this Pack. It is perfect size for a 5LB bag of flour. A friendly reminder for all customers, all our food container measurements are based on water, volume is different from weight, 1LB of water volume is much smaller size than 1LB of dry herb volume. ✅ CUSTOMER SERVICE: Glass is Fragile, if you receive any glass container damaged during the logistic, no worries, please contact customer service for help. RETURN POLICY IS SIMPLE AND EASY INCLUDED IN OUR PRODUCT BOX.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jbHwzJveL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Green","source_asin":"B08PCC29LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PCC29LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PCC29LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
