window.products.push({"id":943874,"name":"RAYAIR SUPPLY - MicroPower Guard Air Filters (3 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517Kau0zlsL._AC_.jpg","description":"This high quality replacement media is for use in a: Micropower Guard, Nature's Home MicroPower Guard, One Hour Xenon Power Guard. These air cleaners utilize polarized media technology enabling it to capture submicron respirable particles. This design provides for simpler filter media changes while still removing the smallest (submicron) particles. Based on average service conditions, approximately 3-4 months between filter cleaning has been shown to be effective in maintaining adequate ventilation flow. Material: The fiberglass media is manufactured from 100% recycled crushed glass known as “cullet.\" The continuous glass fiber manufacturing process eliminates the potential hazards of respirable fiberglass particles within the media pad. The diameter of each fiber is greater than 18 microns which is well above the 3.5 micron size that has been attributed to health concerns. How does it work? When particles such as dust, pet dander and household chemicals pass through the filter, they become polarized. These polarized particles join together to form bigger clusters that are more easily captured and collect on the fiberglass pad with an activated carbon center screen. The full sheet activated carbon center media pad is a non-woven polyester base fabric. The carbon media is UL certified for flame retardancy, class 2. The fiberglass media becomes polarized by the charge from the power supply and acts like a powerful magnet to attract sub-micron particles. What is included? Three (3 Changes) fiberglass media pads with activated carbon center per order. CAUTION: Do not place order using the measurement of disposable fiberglass pad. Measure the outside frame or refer to filter label inside plastic channel. ** The products advertised on this page are manufactured by RayAir Supply. MicroPower Guard is a registered trademark of Clockworks IP, LLC. RayAir Supply is not affiliated with Clockworks IP, LLC.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517Kau0zlsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAYAIR SUPPLY","source_asin":"B07BHTPYT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BHTPYT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BHTPYT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943875,"name":"Heiboa Melamine Marble Round Serving Tray - Set of 2 Round Platters for Serving Food 11 Inch Round Tray for Party Marble Tray for Bathroom Decorative ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+OfjkhxaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Food Grade Melamine - The round serving tray made of food-grade melamine, availible for food. A good serving platter when you serve food and drinks like fruit, snacks, coffee, tea, wine, etc. Marble Texture Round Tray- This melamine tray lighter than ceramic ones but with a delicate porcelain look and feel, more scratch resistant and beautiful, with marble pattern design greatly matching with both modern & vintage styled items. Good decorative tray for kitchen, vanity counter, bathroom, dining table, coffee table, dresser. Size - This marble tray measures 11 inch/28cm diameter, not large serving tray but enough to decently keep decors, makeups, foods and other supplies. Round shape makes it easier to blend into small or bigger tables Widely use - This small tray not only can easy to carry breakfast, coffee, tea, snacks, cakes, or as fruit platters, but also can be as a table organizer to carry jewelry, perfume bottles, hair brushes, cosmetics, candles and bathroom accessories. Best Gift Idea - Except for daily use, it’s also a decent desk decoration & reliable helper for various occasions like Christmas, birthday, wedding, baby shower, housewarming and other parties. A perfect gift for hostess or bride","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+OfjkhxaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heiboa","source_asin":"B09PZZMNK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PZZMNK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PZZMNK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
