window.products.push({"id":943906,"name":"1Easylife Corner Shower Caddy Basket Shelf, 2 Pack Bathroom Caddy Organizer with 8 Hooks, Drill Free Adhesive Storage Organizer, Rustproof Shampoo Hol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712AUGFw6AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUS 304 Stainless Steel】 【Drill Free- Easy to Install】Compare to traditional bathroom shower caddy basket that need be drilled, we adopted traceless adhesive, drill free to the wall, no damage to the wall, easy to install, upgrade and wider adhesive ensure the strong load ability, more durable than suction cup. 【Rustproof-304 Stainless Steel】Our bathroom caddy organizer is made of premium grade 304 stainless steel, which prevents rust formation and protects the underlying metal, great for long lasting use, especially in the wet bathroom. Bottom hollow plaid design, makes the caddy dry quickly. 【Multi-scene Use-Powerful Organizer】This shower caddy take advantage of the 90°corner wall without occupying extra space, it’s perfect as a powerful organizer for shampoo, body wash, soap and more. Besides, it can be used for kitchen spice, it can maximize optimize the kitchen countertop space. 【2 Pack Basket with Different Size 】Larger-9.45 × 9.45 × 2.76 inches, Small-8.66 × 8.66 × 2.76 inches, L-shaped design is great for corner wall. Included 8 hooks is removable, you can hang it anywhere for holding razor, bath towel, bath brush. 6(2 spare) adhesive comes with the package. If you want to adjust the position, just use hairdryer to heat the sticker for tearing it off easily. 【Warranty from 1Easylife】1Easylife is your good helper in your daily life. We offer LIFETIME warranty for your purchase, if you meet any problem with your purchase, contact us without any hesitation, your repurchase is our highest honor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712AUGFw6AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1Easylife","source_asin":"B099N1CQTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099N1CQTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099N1CQTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":943907,"name":"Mara Ceramic Stoneware 16 Oz. Arches Mug (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HGmlqa8EL._AC_.jpg","description":"Listing is for 2 16 Oz. Mugs which measure 5 inches x 3.75 inches x 4.25 inches each. Mara, an accomplished painter, sculptor and ceramicist, studied engraving with the famous artist Alfredo Zalce, who painted many portraits of his lovely artist protégé. After studying art in London, she began working with high-temperature ceramics and created wonderfully unique glazes for her pieces. She then went on to study with the Italian ceramist, Bruno Terese, in Italy. Mara has had numerous expositions of her original pieces in Europe, the United States and Mexico. \"She has developed a fine sensibility in schematic and precise line drawings. Ceramics is no easy medium for precise line drawings, yet Mara has mastered her technique with brush and stylus and has been able to portray her life experiences with unrivaled naturalness. We see her universe on parade in all of her pieces, whether they be vases or plaques. Flowers, birds and geometric designs all represent her personal vision and display her unique perceptions of the world.\" Alfredo Zalce, May 1994 Sadly, after a long illness, Mara passed away in November 2007. Since Ceramica Mara has always been an extended family operation, production of her fine works has continued. Mara's husband, daughter and loyal apprentices have consistently carried out day to day production. Her husband Mariano, an architect, artist and Ceramica Mara business manager, is passionate about continuing Mara's legacy. Her daughter Alexandra, artist and history professor, has also stepped in to help the family make a seamless transition in the continuation of the fine production of Ceramica Mara.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HGmlqa8EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mara Ceramic Stoneware","source_asin":"B0087631OQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0087631OQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0087631OQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
