window.products.push({"id":943924,"name":"Lifeforce Glass Recovery Stones, 6 Daily Reminders for Encouragement in Sobriety on Glass Stones. Perfect for 12 Step Set III.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vC0Io2TGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You never know how you can make a difference in someone’s life. Maybe all someone needs is a little reminder, a little resolve printed on a glass stone. Whether you’re in recovery or not, these six sayings help anyone to realign with their higher good. Your Recovery Stones can support your efforts. Put them in a dish or shallow basket and choose one to concentrate on every day. Put them in a dish or shallow basket and choose one to concentrate on every day. Give them to six friends. Give them to six friends. Take them to meetings. Take them to meetings. Use as motivational tools. Use as motivational tools. Offer them in a “take what you need” box. Offer them in a “take what you need” box. Incorporate them into your counseling practice. Incorporate them into your counseling practice. Make them into magnets. Make them into magnets. The colors of the stones are random and varied. They are translucent and opaque. You will receive one each of the following: Keep Comin' Back! Keep Comin' Back! Openness Willingness Honesty Openness Willingness Honesty Just For Today Just For Today Turn It Over Turn It Over The definition of insanity is doing the same thing over and over expecting a different result. The definition of insanity is doing the same thing over and over expecting a different result. I am a friend of Bill's (Bill Wilson is the founder of AA.) I am a friend of Bill's (Bill Wilson is the founder of AA.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vC0Io2TGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifeforce Glass","source_asin":"B003SZ1166","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-943924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003SZ1166","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003SZ1166","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
